  "description": "Fuaran.Core.Column — the relational/columnar data strand: a typed, null-aware, Arrow-compatible columnar model (int/float/bool/string/date/timestamp/decimal with a first-class validity mask), schema entries that carry a unit, a label, a description and extension members behind builders, and its canonical wire codec (column-oriented, reusing the Fuaran.Core.Wire canonical-float rules so numeric columns are byte-identical across hosts; decode is Result-typed with the codec error envelope, and refuses a cell outside its column type). No tree-witness coupling, no base node type. FSharp.Core only, Fable-clean on encode and decode.",
